---
title: Query Rewriting — Structure
layout: tree-down
hSpacing: 55
vSpacing: 120
---

raw [class] "Raw Query"
history [class] "History"
rewriter [class] "Rewriter (LLM)" { methods: "rewrite(q, hist)" }
retriever [class] "Retriever" { methods: "search(q)" }
fuse [class] "Fuse" { methods: "merge()" }

raw -> rewriter
history -> rewriter
rewriter -> retriever "q1 … qn"
retriever -> fuse "chunks"
